# Editing JES entities
@scenario tutorial_lesson_25
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip guide wave]
pip: The JES example has a panel and a small colored indicator. Each is a separate entity.
pip: Open scripts/scenes/panel.jes in the JES editor. Select the indicator and change its fill color.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
pip: Which change should affect only the indicator?
> Edit the named indicator entity. -> correct
> Tint the entire stage. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show pip guide curious]
pip: Separate entities give the editor independent targets. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip guide cheer]
pip: Separate entities give the editor independent targets.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_25]
[flag tutorial_done_25]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_5]
